# Keep the Cloud Build upload small. The server Dockerfile only needs the monorepo
# source (apps/*, package.json, pnpm-lock.yaml) — not venvs, media, or build output.
# Without this, gcloud uploads core/.venv310 (multi-GB torch/CUDA) as build context.

.git/

# Python virtualenvs (multi-GB with torch/CUDA)
**/.venv/
**/.venv310/
**/__pycache__/

# Node
**/node_modules/
**/.next/
**/.next-codex-build/

# Media & pipeline artifacts (local dev only)
*.mp4
*.wav
*.m4a
*.webm
core/scene_frames/
core/*.srt
core/*.json
core/*.jpg
storage/

# Misc large/local
*.pdf
*.zip
*.docx
gcp-keys/

# 실험·분석 산출물 (2026-08-07 추가). .gcloudignore 가 있으면 .gitignore 는 **무시**되므로
# /tmp/ 를 여기 다시 적어야 한다 — 안 그러면 빌드 컨텍스트가 GB 단위로 불어난다
# (실측: 이게 빠져서 1.9GB 를 업로드했다).
tmp/
logs/
바우처_결과보고_2026/
*.tar
*.pt
*.pth
*.pkl
